{"seq":20,"trial_id":"harness-zero-select-2026-11/zero-min-opus-none-mu-v03-dev/sy-03-marrow-fieldworks-ticket-numbers/r2","wall_ts":"2026-11-05T22:00:47.957Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-16T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"647f6d68b8b9d090c63cacef9f1cd043e301d2c19fb4703036a0d327e21bec34","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"DHARNES0001","text":"Hi Pree, I found three Marrow Fieldworks ticket numbers:\n\n1. *#4409*: from Moss's digest \"Central handoffs next week\" (teams/team-central/digests, 2 Jan 2026). It's a recurring timeout on the Gatehouse Check-In report at the Salina North yard (Bay 4 and the west grain-bin apron, during the 06:00 flatbed intake).\n2. *#4412*: from the same Moss digest. It's a small glitch in the driver SMS prompt when combine trailers are staged on unpaved overflow lots.\n   One caveat on these two: the digest says Hollis flagged them on \"Pree's dealer account\" before the Marrow Fieldworks handoff on 5 Jan. I'm reading that as Marrow Fieldworks, but the digest never ties the ticket numbers to the account name directly.\n3. *PD-5302*: from #central-random. Hollis posted it on Wed 14 Oct as another Marrow Fieldworks ticket, for a follow-up from this week.\n\nPossibly related: *#8841* in #central-random (13 Oct). Tobias flagged West yard Door 2 double-booking on it, on \"Tobias's dealer account.\" It's never called Marrow Fieldworks, so I left it off the list. Tobias can confirm.\n\nNot Marrow Fieldworks: #88412 is Tansleigh Packaging. PD-4821 and FR-882 are Marrow Agrisupply.\n\nOther than Hollis's PD-5302 post, I didn't find anything about Marrow Fieldworks this week in the channels you're in (#central-team, #central-random, #general, #help-it-ops, #inc-tansley-carrier-api). Moss's Central cheat sheet has no ticket numbers, and I can't see any Marrow Fieldworks account files."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"DHARNES0001","ts":"1792159200.000127"}}
